                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "Monitor-only chip, loaded cards, and the vacant card \u2014 bordered like the rest, told apart by \u201cno rack\u201d and the monitor line it omits. Cards sit left-aligned in a wrapping run, fixed 202 wide \u2014 the rig decides how many. Until racks exist (#535) row 5 reads \u201cno rack\u201d on every card and the line under it carries the chain run itself; a populated chain switched off reads \u201cChain off \u00b7 <run>\u201d; the summary caps at two lines with an ellipsis, which the 196\/215 card heights already assume."
